'''Crane Flies''' are a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]]. 

== How to Acquire ==

Flies only fly around in swamps! You can't run after them, which makes them quite tricky to catch.
The easiest way currently is to catch them on horseback, as horses currently move normal speed in a swamp.


